    "body": "I'd personally be in favor of reevaluating the decision. webinstall.dev makes [a good case](https://webinstall.dev/faq/#dont-run-with-shell-pipes) for why their install script pipes to bash directly. If it would require us to update our script to make it more secure, I think that's a small price to pay for usability.",
